@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title Quality Output Lifecycle - Detail

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

[Quality invocation] as Run
artifact "filtered.jsonl" as Filtered
artifact "review_queue.jsonl" as Review
artifact "rejected.jsonl" as Rejected
artifact "spot-check sample\nreplaced" as Sample
artifact "quality manifest\nreplaced" as Manifest

Run --> Filtered
Run --> Review
Run --> Rejected
Run --> Sample
Run --> Manifest

note bottom
Without --append, row files are rebuilt.
With --append, gates and manifest cover only the current batch.
end note

@enduml
